{"h":2857,"lines":[{"y":0.060853835879747686,"c":1,"x":0.084399806644030184,"h":0.017663942341040406,"w":0.10796011606852213,"t":"Audioscripts"},{"t":"Earlier this year, a research team set out to assess all the available evidence so that they","h":0.014534884186538366,"x":0.08650519453425308,"w":0.60899653116861974,"y":0.10901162767203521,"c":1},{"y":0.12491252631735661,"t":"could highlight the potential for music in surgical recovery. They identified nearly a hundred","h":0.016095171448565426,"x":0.084775086243716657,"w":0.63840830485026046,"c":1},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"x":0.086505181154677716,"w":0.62802769978841144,"t":"trials involving a total of seven thousand patients who were played recorded music as part","y":0.14098837185749724},{"y":0.15697674395113592,"c":1,"h":0.014534884186538477,"w":0.62975779215494798,"t":"of their post-operative care. The researchers then looked at what impact the music had on","x":0.084775083072518478},{"h":0.016105342862320682,"c":1,"t":"the patients. They discovered that patients who had been played music reported feeling","y":0.17284814542984706,"w":0.61591695149739578,"x":0.08477508817612299},{"c":1,"w":0.60899653116861985,"t":"happier and more satisfied in the post-operative phase, and the length of their stay was","x":0.086505194526261514,"y":0.1889433167232043,"h":0.014695591322603119},{"x":0.086505195428075859,"c":1,"w":0.41695500691731768,"h":0.01308139510051276,"y":0.20494186058599173,"t":"shorter than for patients who had not listened to any music."},{"x":0.084692302903397382,"w":0.63510650634765631,"c":1,"t":"The researchers also explored the patients' choice of music, and their findings showed that","y":0.22389324256008036,"h":0.019877358363840969},{"w":0.62629755655924479,"y":0.24273255826170903,"h":0.013081395100512871,"t":"a wide variety of music styles was evident. However, a common factor was that the chosen","c":1,"x":0.086505200870786225},{"h":0.018394177238619247,"c":1,"t":"music had a calming quality. Some of the patients listened to music with headphones, but","x":0.084724494315510837,"y":0.2564361642288695,"w":0.62812550862630212},{"t":"it was quiet enough not to prevent them from being able to communicate with nurses","h":0.014707796885635172,"x":0.086505205122616599,"w":0.59688578287760419,"y":0.27325581420637002,"c":1},{"h":0.015988371937820434,"c":1,"t":"and other staff. More often though, the mode of delivery was by what are known as music","x":0.08477507728717687,"y":0.28924418611852265,"w":0.62802769978841133},{"t":"pillows. These broadcast sound that is only audible to the person lying on them. The","y":0.30668604627661489,"c":1,"x":0.084775098386099895,"w":0.58823527018229171,"h":0.014534884186538477},{"c":1,"x":0.083044979319112616,"y":0.32120363870270197,"w":0.62975779215494798,"h":0.016095171448565537,"t":"research involved testing music before, during or after operations or a combination. Some"},{"c":1,"h":0.017584260149048792,"y":0.33720930204333821,"x":0.084775079297443434,"w":0.60553634643554688,"t":"patients listened to the music just once a day, while others had several episodes a day."},{"h":0.018850983899318718,"c":1,"x":0.084682738269337435,"y":0.37928129294671109,"w":0.6039714050292968,"t":"When asked to report their experience of listening to music, surgical patients said that"},{"y":0.39678096575283062,"x":0.084775084371700546,"t":"either they had no feelings of anxiety at any point, or those feelings were only slight.","h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.59169550577799479,"c":1},{"y":0.41279069774915467,"w":0.57785466512044281,"h":0.015988371937820434,"c":1,"t":"Patients who hadn't listened to music, on the other hand, reported higher levels of","x":0.084775089515655155},{"h":0.01469559132260323,"w":0.62629755655924479,"t":"dissatisfaction. This feedback from all of the patients was then cross-checked against their","c":1,"x":0.084775097052027779,"y":0.42862141362012074},{"y":0.44471658486646515,"w":0.61937718709309897,"t":"medical notes. And in every case, those who were given music to listen to didn't need as","h":0.016095171448565315,"c":1,"x":0.084775074202603801},{"x":0.084775091342683115,"t":"much medication to ease their pain as those patients who weren't played music. The type","y":0.46075581402853572,"w":0.62456746419270837,"c":1,"h":0.016151113890533697},{"t":"of music, patient choice and timing, before, during or after the surgery didn't make much","x":0.084775085627683919,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820545,"w":0.62283737182617194,"y":0.47674418612185476},{"c":1,"y":0.49122096632877987,"h":0.017844645271274606,"w":0.64369333902994785,"x":0.084734632117413569,"t":"difference. And it even worked when patients were played music under general anaesthetic,"},{"t":"although the positive effects were greater when patients were awake.","y":0.50872092999705232,"h":0.014534884186538477,"x":0.084775091520618129,"w":0.48615915934244791,"c":1},{"x":0.084775079904623324,"c":1,"w":0.62110727945963551,"y":0.53044086750457686,"h":0.016095171448565426,"t":"All the evidence suggests that music has a positive effect on post-operative patients, but"},{"t":"it's not entirely clear how or why this is the case. A lot of people listen to music in daily life","h":0.018244148718885245,"y":0.5448518542909232,"c":1,"x":0.084736840173675693,"w":0.6281110636393229},{"c":1,"y":0.56250000012201773,"w":0.64013839721679688,"x":0.086505195780959956,"h":0.01308139510051276,"t":"as a way to relax and forget their problems, but the researchers came to the conclusion that"},{"w":0.61072662353515628,"c":1,"h":0.016095171448565426,"x":0.084775101921868129,"y":0.57697690700743187,"t":"it worked on patients by distraction. I suppose it was something familiar and gave them"},{"t":"something they could control.","w":0.21135134379069009,"c":1,"h":0.017026117750612357,"y":0.59205695410656312,"x":0.08631372425440352},{"x":0.086441025050858405,"y":0.61295208440664739,"h":0.017099918394842928,"c":1,"w":0.61602635701497399,"t":"The researchers say there is now sufficient research to demonstrate that music should be"},{"t":"available to all patients undergoing operations. They say patients should be able to choose","x":0.084725898775487987,"y":0.63042987805530781,"h":0.017550757416817886,"w":0.63504358927408866,"c":1},{"w":0.62802769978841144,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"y":0.64680232565586182,"t":"what they'd like to listen to, and if they prefer, recordings taken from nature can be just as","x":0.084775077323041043},{"t":"good as music. Surgical teams may prefer patients to listen to music before the procedure","c":1,"x":0.084775077355974601,"y":0.66270118984245552,"w":0.62802769978841155,"h":0.016095171448565426},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"x":0.086505192677146001,"w":0.63148788452148441,"t":"or as soon as they arrive back onto the ward. Clearly, there's more to learn about this area,","y":0.67877906953012379},{"t":"and the team now plan to focus their next research on the most appropriate volume to play","w":0.63674962361653642,"h":0.015112115420854666,"x":0.086470568583713436,"y":0.69421547930055127,"c":1},{"w":0.47923873901367187,"c":1,"t":"the music at. And I look forward to reading the results of their study.","h":0.01469559132260323,"x":0.086505197873204293,"y":0.71063680864319945},{"w":0.20476394653320315,"h":0.017839693372444843,"c":1,"x":0.086172663199202942,"t":"It will be interesting to see ...","y":0.73098586151058487},{"x":0.7491349479663818,"w":0.034602076212565058,"y":0.14244186055294128,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"t":"Q32"},{"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"t":"Q33","x":0.7491349479663818,"y":0.26017441869247615,"w":0.034602076212565058},{"h":0.013081395100512871,"x":0.74913494797147029,"c":1,"y":0.30668604659731535,"t":"Q34","w":0.034602076212565169},{"x":0.7491349479663818,"y":0.39825581404131327,"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"t":"Q35","w":0.034602076212565058},{"y":0.46075581403917587,"t":"Q36","w":0.034602076212565169,"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"x":0.74913494797147029},{"x":0.74913494797147029,"y":0.50872093031824561,"c":1,"h":0.013081395100512871,"w":0.034602076212565169,"t":"Q37"},{"t":"Q38","c":1,"x":0.7491349479663818,"w":0.034602076212565058,"y":0.5784883718744801,"h":0.011627907349230804},{"x":0.084775087017474979,"t":"116","h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"y":0.96075581404131327,"w":0.032871971130371103}],"w":2400}